{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"claim","type":"text","text":"Claim\n\nWave 2 (S7–S10) added 50 codes and 18 memos and no new overview category. The 14 CAT / 4 PH set held. New interviews densified properties. This is local sufficiency for this thesis sample — not worldwide saturation.","x":-400,"y":-80,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"not_claim","type":"text","text":"Not claimed\n\nEvery property saturated. Lecturer-side CATs re-sampled. S9 as a strong test. Abstraction deficit closed. Transfer to other countries/universities.","x":80,"y":-80,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"matrix","type":"text","text":"Panel 2 — densification (not “nothing new”)\n\nKey: empty · inst. · new property · neg./boundary\n\nCAT1  S7 neg.  S8 new   S9 inst.  S10 neg.\nCAT2  S7 —     S8 inst. S9 —      S10 —     (switch = CAT14)\nCAT3  S7 inst. S8 inst. S9 inst.  S10 —\nCAT4  S7 new   S8 inst. S9 inst.  S10 inst.\nCAT5  S7 new   S8 inst. S9 —      S10 new\nCAT6  S7 inst. S8 new   S9 new    S10 new\nCAT7  S7 inst. S8 inst. S9 —      S10 —\nCAT8  S7 new   S8 inst. S9 inst.  S10 —\nCAT9  S7 new   S8 inst. S9 no     S10 inst.\nCAT10 S7 inst. S8 —     S9 —      S10 inst.\nCAT11 S7 new   S8 new   S9 —      S10 —\nCAT12 S7 new   S8 —     S9 inst.  S10 new\nCAT13 S7 —     S8 —     S9 no     S10 inst.\nCAT14 S7 new   S8 new   S9 no     S10 new","x":-650,"y":580,"width":920,"height":480,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"stop","type":"text","text":"Stop rule\n\nLocal sufficiency of the 14-category set + recruitment constraint.\nNot “the theory is finished.” Unfulfilled OQs stay labelled.","x":500,"y":490,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"chart","type":"text","text":"Overview CAT count\n\n14 |  * ──────────── *\n    |  *\n    |\n 0  +── wave 1 ──── wave 2 ──→\n      10 cases      S7–S10","x":1070,"y":-100,"width":470,"height":260,"color":"6"},
